Hi {Owner},

I build websites for independent restaurants around {City}. {Business Name} has dishes people clearly love on its social pages, but no menu a hungry person can read on a phone and no way to order pickup direct.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: the menu as real text, today's hours, a specials board you can edit from your phone, direct pickup ordering and a catering form, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and menu changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes between lunch and dinner?

